(text "HEEL SWITCH" (at 55.88 199.39 0) (effects (font (size 1.5 1.5) bold) (justify left bottom)) (uuid 5e7b16b5-3dc9-4127-9026-dd6215a9e38c))
(text "SWITCHES (internal pull-ups)" (at 170.18 218.44 0) (effects (font (size 1.5 1.5) bold) (justify left bottom)) (uuid f9188076-8429-423e-8f1e-b02ba9d42fc2))
(text "OPERATOR INPUTS (RC-filtered ADC)" (at 20.32 139.7 0) (effects (font (size 1.5 1.5) bold) (justify left bottom)) (uuid 61433a57-af1b-44f4-b21d-1e63dd3eb5ba))
(text "NOTES. A concept drawn by Claude at Bob Drzyzgula's direction, October 2026: not built, not tested, values not checked." (at 20.32 258.6 0) (effects (font (size 1.15 1.15) bold) (justify left bottom)) (uuid b47f1507-b9d6-4c4a-8e7e-2d6108a8f0f9))
(text "1. After Freescale AN1662: zero-cross interrupt sets a timer alarm (or a PIO program); at the firing delay a ~100 us gate pulse fires the" (at 20.32 261.0 0) (effects (font (size 1.15 1.15)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid 79a3070b-3d07-4e7f-be96-46f69a828756))
(text "   triac; hand-wheel period from edge timestamps; speed loop every half-cycle (120 Hz); stall watchdog. Added: isolation, relay, inputs." (at 20.32 263.40000000000003 0) (effects (font (size 1.15 1.15)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid 250ceb5c-4e5a-451c-ae2e-4fe6f7c6c6a8))
(text "2. Pins (RP2350B): FIRE GP4; RELAY GP5; ZC GP6; HALL (index) GP7; ENC_A/B GP2/GP3 (PIO counter); STITCH GP10; HEEL GP11; NEEDLE GP12;" (at 20.32 265.8 0) (effects (font (size 1.15 1.15)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid 2bbd67da-1c57-4ba6-9f5d-76836f570e16))
(text "   knee, pedal, FSR, limit on ADC0-3 (GP40-43); ISENSE ADC4; ADC5-7 spare; GP8/GP9 UART1 for debug (or USB serial). Avoid GP0, GP23, GP25 (PSRAM, key, LED)." (at 20.32 268.20000000000005 0) (effects (font (size 1.15 1.15)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid 41283df7-a760-4aa8-91f6-5ea9355ccd4e))
(text "3. PS1 feeds VSYS through D2, so USB and PS1 may both be connected. Until a built board's isolation is checked, unplug the mains before USB or SWD. Drive GP4 at 8-12 mA." (at 20.32 270.6 0) (effects (font (size 1.15 1.15)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid d24ba692-cf46-4e47-a305-fbe3d3db636e))
(text "4. Fire only after a zero-cross has been seen and the command is zero; close K1 last and open it first; if zero-crosses stop, stop firing and open K1. Never scope the line side." (at 20.32 273.0 0) (effects (font (size 1.15 1.15)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid 58beb216-a55b-433a-96cf-55c4227d2867))
(text "5. R7/R8: ~3.9 mA peak in the H11AA1; R11: ~8 mA into U3 from 3.3 V; R6/C2 fitted only if a snubberless triac false-fires. T1 optional: the bridge's AC lead through its window, 0.1 V/A about 1.65 V." (at 20.32 275.40000000000003 0) (effects (font (size 1.15 1.15)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid 038fd47f-354d-488d-9ed6-44ebb872eb7a))
(text "6. On a WeAct RP2350B Core board, feed PS1 to the 5V pin: the board has its own diode from USB VBUS, so D2 may be left out." (at 20.32 277.8 0) (effects (font (size 1.15 1.15)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid 9f038786-0b93-4772-883e-4c48939cbf27))
(text "7. Heel: momentary switch to GND in either pedal (J5 pin 4, J6 pin 3); a heel tap sends the needle to its other stop." (at 20.32 280.20000000000005 0) (effects (font (size 1.15 1.15)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid d6fa0119-a422-4179-8392-61b212f9456c))
(text "8. Encoder U5/U6 (ring of alternating magnets) optional: stops taught and landed by angle; 5-wire cable (3V3, GND, index, A, B)." (at 20.32 282.6 0) (effects (font (size 1.15 1.15)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid f18eb78d-4642-4105-8e35-a56f4b1af3cd))
(text "9. RECTIFIED-DC VARIANT: BR1 turns the triac's output into DC; D3 carries the motor's current between firings. J3 is the motor's own keyed" (at 20.32 285.0 0) (effects (font (size 1.15 1.15)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid 86e8f8f5-807b-4c7a-9feb-d2b999cdbfb0))
(text "   connector (or the leads pass through and are hardwired), never a mains outlet, and is at line potential. T1 sits on the AC side: a CT can't sense DC." (at 20.32 287.40000000000003 0) (effects (font (size 1.15 1.15)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid d3bb976e-c7a1-4b88-8ce2-17894e2eae21))
  (sheet_instances (path "/" (page "1"))))
